# Testing the edge cases for the nodes and edges of a graph

# Test 1 - standard case with rounding

CreateGraph simpleGraph1

AddNode simpleGraph1 A
AddNode simpleGraph1 B
AddNode simpleGraph1 C

AddEdge simpleGraph1 A B 1.999
AddEdge simpleGraph1 B C 2.9995
AddEdge simpleGraph1 A C 3.0

# Test 2 - case involving cycling of edges

CreateGraph simpleGraph2

AddNode simpleGraph2 A
AddNode simpleGraph2 B

AddEdge simpleGraph2 A B 1.000
AddEdge simpleGraph2 B A 2.9996
AddEdge simpleGraph2 A B 3.0001

# Test 3 - case involving a duplicate edge to one node

CreateGraph simpleGraph3

AddNode simpleGraph3 A

AddEdge simpleGraph3 A A 1.000
AddEdge simpleGraph3 A A 2.0


